    audience: ["user", "admin"],
    tags: ["skills", "soft skills", "professional skills", "certification", "test center"],
    content: "The **Professional Skills Program** is a set of 17 short Zebron courses (about 45 minutes each) on the soft skills employers look for. Each course has a **Skill quiz** you can practise on the Test Center's **Skills** page, and the program ends with a Zebron certification.\n\n# The courses\n\n| Group | Courses |\n| --- | --- |\n| **Mindsets** | 1 Growth Mindset · 2 Persistence · 3 Personal Responsibility · 4 Future Orientation |\n| **Behavioral skills** | 5 Teamwork · 6 Communication · 7 Proactiveness · 8 Orientation to Detail |\n| **Workplace & career** | 9 Career Development: Up, Across and Beyond · 10 Being a New Teammate · 11 Bouncing Back from Early Failure · 12 Working with Challenging Coworkers · 13 Peer Coaching · 14 Managing Time and Priorities · 15 Stress Management |\n| **Leadership & management** | 16 Leadership · 17 Management |\n\nEach course has 3 modules of 3 lessons, with a tip and a quick check in every lesson, and a final exam of 12 questions drawn from its 18-question skill quiz (70% to pass).\n\n# The Skills page\n\nOpen **Test Center → Skills** (or **/test-center/skills**). Skills are grouped as above; use the group chips or the search to find one.\n\n- **Practise** opens the skill quiz: practise all of it or one topic, with instant feedback.\n- **Take the course** opens the course that teaches the skill.\n- **Earn a certification** opens the Certifications tab.\n\nOn your organization's Test Center, the Skills page shows the Zebron skill quizzes your organization has linked to its programs (Test Center → Structure → a program's **Zebron quizzes**), plus your own quizzes of type **Skill**.\n\n# The certification\n\n**Zebron Certified Professional Skills**: complete the 17 courses in order (each final exam passed), then pass a 51-question exam drawn from all of them (3 per course), 75% to pass, 75 minutes, 3 attempts then a 7-day wait. Valid for 3 years.\n\n# For Zebron administrators\n\nContent: `scripts/professional-skills-program/`. Seed it with:\n\n- `node scripts/seed-professional-skills-program.mjs --check` (validate)\n- `node scripts/seed-professional-skills-program.mjs --apply` (write; add `--overwrite` to replace, learner progress is kept)\n\nThe program engine (`scripts/lib/seed-program.mjs`) has two options for this kind of program: `quizType: \"skill\"` (the quizzes appear on the Skills page; `quiz.skillGroup` and `quiz.icon` group and decorate them) and `examQuestions` (questions per final exam; default 20).",
